",193.74,193.86],["blow",193.86,194.1],["them",194.1,194.28],["up?",194.28,194.5],["You'll",195.24,195.56],["need",195.56,195.78],["a",195.78,195.92],["pump.",195.92,196.18],["I'll",196.68,197.04],["put",197.04,197.2],["one",197.2,197.4],["in",197.4,197.54],["for",197.54,197.78],["you.",197.78,198.04]]},{"start":199.12,"end":206.16,"text":"Okay, now, um, what other things are you looking for? Well, thinking about the cooking equipment,","words":[["Okay,",199.12,199.66],["now,",200.12,200.5],["um,",200.88,201.28],["what",201.54,201.78],["other",201.78,202.12],["things",202.12,202.4],["are",202.4,202.56],["you",202.56,202.64],["looking",202.64,202.86],["for?",202.86,203.24],["Well,",203.8,204.2],["thinking",204.4,204.74],["about",204.74,205.08],["the",205.08,205.28],["cooking",205.28,205.6],["equipment,",205.6,206.16]]},{"start":206.7,"end":213.0,"text":"we need a stove. There are all sorts of camping stoves. It depends what fuel you want it to run","words":[["we",206.7,206.88],["need",206.88,207.06],["a",207.06,207.16],["stove.",207.16,207.54],["There",208.28,208.58],["are",208.58,208.72],["all",208.72,208.96],["sorts",208.96,209.28],["of",209.28,209.52],["camping",209.52,209.78],["stoves.",209.78,210.36],["It",210.94,211.1],["depends",211.1,211.5],["what",211.5,211.72],["fuel",211.72,212.14],["you",212.14,212.36],["want",212.36,212.54],["it",212.54,212.68],["to",212.68,212.84],["run",212.84,213.0]]},{"start":213.0,"end":221.4,"text":"on. There's kerosene, charcoal. Oh, that sounds too messy. I think we want the fuel to be","words":[["on.",213.0,213.16],["There's",213.76,214.18],["kerosene,",214.18,214.96],["charcoal.",215.44,215.84],["Oh,",216.44,216.8],["that",217.0,217.2],["sounds",217.2,217.52],["too",217.52,217.9],["messy.",217.9,218.56],["I",219.36,219.74],["think",219.74,220.26],["we",220.26,220.52],["want",220.52,220.72],["the",220.72,220.88],["fuel",220.88,221.1],["to",221.1,221.26],["be",221.26,221.4]]},{"start":221.4,"end":227.28,"text":"gas if possible. N